Look for the WAD files under /tmp.

Upstream's FILES_DIR is /mnt, which Tilck does not mount. /tmp is a
ramfs, always present, and is where the previous patch already sends
the config and savegames -- one directory rather than two.

--- a/fbdoom/config.h
+++ b/fbdoom/config.h
@@ -97,4 +97,4 @@
 #undef ORIGCODE
 
 /* Define to the directory where all game files are located */
-#define FILES_DIR "/mnt"
+#define FILES_DIR "/tmp"
